@consumer = http://localhost:4133/odata/v4/shop

### Cross-service expand: local → remote
### Local Reviews, each expanded with its remote Product (batch-fetch + stitch)
GET {{consumer}}/Reviews?$expand=product

### Cross-service expand: remote → local
### Remote Customers, each expanded with local Bookmarks (reverse fetch)
GET {{consumer}}/Customers?$expand=bookmarks

### Cross-service navigation: filter a local entity by a remote field
### Reviews whose remote product is in the Electronics category
GET {{consumer}}/Reviews?$filter=product/category eq 'Electronics'&$expand=product

### Deep: remote customer → local bookmarks, selecting a few fields
GET {{consumer}}/Customers?$select=ID,name&$expand=bookmarks($select=label)

### Plain remote read (no expand) for comparison
GET {{consumer}}/Customers
